              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Bobbie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made a huge batch of this and shared it with friends who all raved about it. I did make a few modifications. I used oil not lard and added canned/drained pinto beans and a can of rotelle (not drained). I lived in New Mexico for 9 years and this stew is very authentic."
